  "description": "*\"How nice it would be if I could just sleep soundly for one day without thinking about anything.\"* \n\nKim Ga-Hee, a nurse who is exhausted from her current life due to excessive work stress and who spends her days listless without a single person close to her, lost her memories of nearly five years due to a sudden accident. The problem is that she seems to have had a boyfriend.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
